{"synopsis":"Ceritanya tentang Ji Suwon, seorang siswa baru SMA biasa yang memiliki bakat menggambar. Ia jatuh cinta pada seorang gadis yang sudah punya pacar, tetapi kemudian bertemu Seol Hyorim, gadis tercantik di sekolah, dan langsung jatuh cinta padanya. Ia menggambar gadis itu secara diam-diam, tetapi gambarnya ditemukan oleh Yang Jinsu dan diperlihatkan kepada Seol Hyorim. Apakah cinta pertama Suwon yang kedua dapat dipertahankan?","alternative_title":"별이삼샵, Ginseng Star Store","author":"Hyuno (혀노)","artist":"Hyuno (혀노)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"87893099-e93a-43ec-a655-9456c84646a0","number":"216","chapter":"216","title":"","date":"2026-01-12","released":"2026-01-12"},{"chapter_id":"942d5285-e20b-4c0d-9cbc-9ef24c980575","number":"215","chapter":"215","title":"","date":"2026-01-12","released":"2026-01-12"},{"chapter_id":"33786dfa-c20d-4713-9ed6-c87f11fbf00a","number":"214","chapter":"214","title":"","date":"2026-01-11","released":"2026-01-11"},{"chapter_id":"5e9851b1-e97c-4b61-9ff4-b237228d97fe","number":"213","chapter":"213","title":"","date":"2026-01-10","released":"2026-01-10"},{"chapter_id":"34152bdf-a7de-49f2-8d41-95acb1068fc8","number":"212","chapter":"212","title":"","date":"2026-01-10","released":"2026-01-10"},{"chapter_id":"a7ca7c4c-aab2-478b-8f09-cc6b4fdeb9e0","number":"211","chapter":"211","title":"","date":"2026-01-08","released":"2026-01-08"},{"chapter_id":"c8dcfe88-8a16-4be9-a3b5-65598b87d3ac","number":"210","chapter":"210","title":"","date":"2026-01-07","released":"2026-01-07"},{"chapter_id":"90b15740-96d4-4a8e-91da-f305a5aba6a9","number":"209","chapter":"209","title":"","date":"2026-01-04","released":"2026-01-04"},{"chapter_id":"c22ec008-f9fa-485f-bfc1-373fbfc26ac9","number":"208","chapter":"208","title":"","date":"2025-12-28","released":"2025-12-28"},{"chapter_id":"60ceac7f-6364-4578-abe5-8293371ff92d","number":"207","chapter":"207","title":"","date":"2025-12-27","released":"2025-12-27"},{"chapter_id":"d4981224-8fec-4ef0-b754-c1a3f675c5e4","n